import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Maintenance and repair log">
  <h1>Maintenance and repair log</h1>
  <p>Use this page as a printable checklist and record template. It is intentionally not an online database: entries typed into the page are not saved. Keep completed records in a personal document or with the vehicle's invoices.</p>

  <h2>Vehicle record</h2>
  <table><tbody>
    <tr><th>Model year / model</th><td>2021 Volvo S60 — record the vehicle's exact model year and body style</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Engine badge / code</th><td>Record T5, T6, T8 Recharge or Polestar Engineered, plus the verified engine code</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Drivetrain / transmission</th><td>Record FWD, mechanical AWD or T8 electric-rear-axle AWD, and transmission code</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Trim / market / production date</th><td>Record from the vehicle's build information</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Paint code / wheel / brake package</th><td>Record from vehicle labels and VIN-specific parts information</td></tr>
    <tr><th>VIN</th><td>Keep in private records; do not publish on this website.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
  <p class="note"><strong>Example configuration:</strong> some owner-specific notes elsewhere in this reference relate to a T5 Inscription AWD. Use this record to capture the configuration of the actual car being serviced; do not treat that example as the specification for every 2021 S60.</p>

  <h2>Service entry template</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Odometer</th><th>Work / parts / fluid specification</th><th>Receipt / next due</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>________</td><td>________</td><td>________________________________</td><td>________________</td></tr>
      <tr><td>________</td><td>________</td><td>________________________________</td><td>________________</td></tr>
      <tr><td>________</td><td>________</td><td>________________________________</td><td>________________</td></tr>
      <tr><td>________</td><td>________</td><td>________________________________</td><td>________________</td></tr>
      <tr><td>________</td><td>________</td><td>________________________________</td><td>________________</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Repair detail checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Customer concern / symptom and exact warning message.</li>
    <li>Diagnostic trouble codes and scan-tool report saved before clearing.</li>
    <li>Parts manufacturer, part number, and batch if relevant.</li>
    <li>Fluid brand, exact specification, and quantity used.</li>
    <li>Measurements taken and source of torque/specification values.</li>
    <li>Work performed, technician, date, odometer, and invoice number.</li>
    <li>Post-repair checks and whether the original symptom returned.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Drivetrain-specific history</h2>
  <p>For mechanical AWD vehicles, record work involving the rear differential, angle gear/bevel gear, propeller shaft, rear drive unit, or AWD control system. For T8 Recharge, record hybrid-system inspections and charging-related service performed by qualified personnel. Do not assume the same components or service intervals apply to FWD, mechanical AWD and T8 electric-rear-axle vehicles.</p>
</BaseLayout>
